' S-548 (F1) / S-549 (F3): with every channel in use `OPEN ... AS handle` stops with a clear error instead of opening channel 0.
' (The MIR interpreter cannot report it: its own diagnostic log needs a file number too, S-623.)
DIM i AS I32
DIM f AS FILE_HANDLE
FOR i = 1 TO 255
    OPEN "fh_full.txt" FOR OUTPUT AS #i
NEXT
OPEN "fh_full2.txt" FOR OUTPUT AS f
PRINT "olmamali"
